[00:09.80] A dark formation in the skies
[00:15.81] Unites the powers in her eyes
[00:21.72] Her soul's inhaling all the living light
[00:27.82] Bringing on the dark, eternal night
[00:33.80] Gathering evil in all its might
[00:48.19] Seven years
[00:54.46] Purity
[01:00.96] Innocence
[01:07.14] Dignity
[01:13.51] Hail, hail the queen!
[01:21.97] Ruling supreme
[01:29.54] 
[02:21.01] She is queen alone in this human zone, dethroned the king unpure
[02:29.63] The masses were assured, she fought without a sword
[02:33.74] She regained their hope and faith
[02:40.64] Draining the liar in the crimson water
[02:43.91] To bring him eternal pain
[02:45.35] His soul is slaughtered
[02:47.58] Eternalizing pain
[02:48.93] Scream in silence, no one shall hear his cries encaged
[02:52.86] The unroyal king, surrendered to the child of life divine
[03:03.35] A hundred fortnights passed but still no signs of aging
[03:08.49] Her endless youth were amazed, the world was raging
